   {id:'cognition',label:t('了解你，也允许纠正','Understand and correct'),title:t('它如何理解你，你看得见','See how it understands you'),description:t('从自我、当前生活、联系人记录、人生时间轴和人物关系五个视图了解你。判断能回到来源，候选与确认分开；纠正一条理解，保留原版，并让更新进入下一次协作。','Understand yourself through five views: profile, life now, contact history, timeline, and relationships. Trace judgments to sources, distinguish candidates from confirmed context, and carry corrections into future work.'),note:t('确认事实与候选分开；选中的认知附版本和有限证据摘录。当前不是全库语义检索，也不会自动把推测变成事实。','Confirmed facts and candidates stay separate. Selected context carries versions and bounded evidence excerpts. This is not full semantic retrieval, and inferences do not become facts automatically.'),status:t('已实现','Implemented'),action:t('查看自我认识','Explore your profile'),target:'self',steps:[t('查看理解','Inspect context'),t('回到依据','Open evidence'),t('纠正并保留版本','Correct with history')]},
   {id:'life',label:t('工作与生活','Work and life'),title:t('把眼前的事，放回长期目标里','Keep today connected to the longer view'),description:t('工作任务、家人、导师与休息时间，都影响一周的取舍。将长期目标放回当前生活，安排获授权的例行工作；继续建设只在有变化或需要你判断时提醒的主动协作。','Work, family, mentors, and rest all shape the week. Bring long-term goals into life now and authorize routines, while building toward proactive help that surfaces meaningful changes and decisions.'),note:t('自动化依赖本机服务运行。电脑活动是明确标注的 Dev 示例，尚未采集这台电脑的跨应用历史。','Automations depend on the local service staying active. Computer activity is a labelled Dev example, with no cross-app collection on this computer.'),status:t('本机能力与 Dev','Local features and Dev'),action:t('安排本机自动化','Explore local automations'),target:'automations',steps:[t('本周重点','This week'),t('安排例行工作','Set a routine'),t('回看与调整','Review and adjust')]},
   {id:'experts',label:t('你的专家与团队','Your experts and team'),title:t('给不同事情，合适的伙伴','The right partner for each kind of work'),description:t('从 108 个职责预设中选择起点，再补上你的目标与做事方式。每位助理有工牌、模型与持续会话，也可以加入同一个群聊。','Start with one of 108 role presets, then add your goals and ways of working. Each assistant has an identity, a model, and an ongoing conversation, and can join a shared room.'),note:t('108 指角色预设数量，不是已接入的外部服务。群聊按明确角色顺序协作，不宣称自治并行团队。','108 counts role presets, not integrated external services. Group conversations use explicit sequential roles, not an autonomous parallel team.'),status:t('已实现','Implemented'),action:t('发现合适的专家','Discover experts'),target:'agents',steps:[t('选择职责','Choose a role'),t('加入个人背景','Add your context'),t('一起协作','Work as a team')]},
